We’re definitely gonna have a war.

00:00:15.307 --> 00:00:16.934
She’s wild.

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:20.896
She’ll be the ruin of this family.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:23.065
And she doesn’t know how to
behave like a proper young lady.

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:28.237
No, thanks.

00:00:32.366 --> 00:00:33.450
Wild nights!

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.578
Were I with thee

